\pard\b\fs28 Immaculate Mary\b0\fs22\par
\par
Immaculate Mary, your praises we sing,\par
You reign now in heaven with Jesus our king\par
\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Most blessed of women to whom was revealed,\par
The plan of salvation for ages concealed\par
\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
O perfect disciple, you cherished God\u8217?s word;\par
Proclaimed by your virtue, the good news you heard\par
\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
\par
O mother of mercy, the cross of your Son\par
Has brought us to new life: in him we are one.\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
\par
So now with the saints and the angels above\par
We join you in praising our God who is love.\par
\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
Ave, ave, ave Maria\par
